IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-SPARQ-ULTRA-MAX.

DATA DIVISION.
01 TOTAL-TOKENS        PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 SPARSITY-PCT        PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 SNR-DB              PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 GAIN-RATIO-X100     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-SPARQ-ULTRA-MAX.
    IF TOTAL-TOKENS == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 53 TO SNR-DB.
    MOVE 310 TO GAIN-RATIO-X100.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 TOTAL-TOKENS.
    WEIGHT 30 GAIN-RATIO-X100.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
